the town of gravity falls is not an  ordinary town and these people believe  that they are totally unique have you  ever wondered what they look like in  real life dipper pines is just as  adorable so make sure you've watched the  video until the end to see him hey guys  check out our new member of the family  toy hub toy hub is the ultimate place  for kids to get their daily dose of  crunchy slime squishy slime sticky slime  play-doh color learning and so much more  we have lots of fun with the most  awesome toys and amazing stories for  kids make sure to show it to all the  kids in your family and while you're  there make sure to subscribe and hit  that like button at toy hub it's  playtime don't forget to subscribe to  our Channel and give this video a big  thumbs up if you're a gravity falls fan  today we're checking out 10 gravity  falls characters in real life Wendy  Fleur Bell corduroy you can't deny it  wendy is one of the coolest characters  on the show she's still laid-back and  down to earth that her attitude makes  her instantly lovable and relatable to  alternators who are holding on to a job  that they are not enjoying as a  fifteen-year-old wendy is quite tall for  her age we absolutely adore her long red  hair she usually wears lumberjack  clothing mainly because her father is a  lumberjack she's best friends with  dipper who's also insanely in love with  her why wouldn't he be wendy is totally  gorgeous we found a very talented  cosplayers who decided to dress up as  windy check her out her name is Kristina  Horner and she's totally rockin this  windy outfit complete with her long red  hair she was really meant to be a  real-life version of Wendy and we love  her cartoon look of course no gravity  falls cosplay is complete without all  characters Kristina gathered her friends  and they all totally nailed the gravity  falls characters can you name them all  don't worry we'll spend some time  talking about every single character in  this video in real life wendy has voiced  by Linda Cardellini if her voice sounds  familiar to you before here's why Linda  also voices Velma and Scooby Doo and  Megan sparkles in Sanjay and Craig she  really gives Wendy a unique personality  and makes her stand out from the rest  Gideon gleeful Gideon is one of those  characters you can't help but love from  his iconic little old me song to all of  his creepy letters Gideon  he adds a certain spice the show and  makes it slightly awkward as well as  fabulously entertaining Gideon is not  very popular with the pines family due  to his antics as a child psychic he's  constantly trying to manipulate other  people to get what he wants and  eventually ruled the town he often uses  his cute looks to trick people into  giving him what he wants but more than  often it doesn't work gravity falls fans  usually cannot stand his cunning and  sneaky personality but you have to admit  the show wouldn't be the same without  him well he still appears to be popular  with the cosplaying crowd because we  just found a bunch of real-life Gideon's  and they all look fabulous check these  out Gideon's voice belongs to the  legendary Thoreau van orman who's a  writer and producer for several iconic  shows like the Powerpuff Girls and  Adventure Time he's also a storyboard  artist for Sanjay and Craig and has been  praised for giving originality to his  stories as well as the characters and  although syrup doesn't look anything  like Gideon in real life there are tons  of cosplayers out there who can recreate  the characters look down to a tee bill  cipher those ciphers a character not  even Gideon can handle and we totally  understand why if you saw them for the  first time you'd have no idea what just  happened you see Bill is a floating  yellow triangle with arms and legs and a  somewhat sadistic sense of humor he can  also easily teleport from one place to  another bill doesn't care about any  rules like any true antagonist but he  believes that he's right about  everything there are a lot of mysteries  revolving around bill what we do know is  that he turns red when he's angry but  his actual size is still unclear  sometimes he's seen as ridiculously  small while other times he's pretty big  you think he'd be an impossible  character to cosplay but you're wrong  check out these amazing cosplayers  totally nailing the real-life bill  cipher look first is a deviantART user  called decayed nightmare who looks like  a perfect healer version of the  character vampire 4-9-8 also did an  amazing job at showing off his cosplay  skills bill ciphers voice belongs to  alex hirsch who's also a writer for the  show a few years ago a real-life bill  cipher appeared on the gravity falls  subreddit and decided to do an  absolutely hilarious ima that showed off  his odd sense of humor and sarcasm to  give you an idea he claimed that his  favorite song is  the 10 hours of rising Shepard tone  YouTube video it's no wonder he's the  creator's favorite character Shonda  Jimenez Shandra Jimenez is gravity falls  news reporter her job is totally  hilarious considering the events of the  town she only has several cameos  throughout the series but she's best  known for being Toby's crush Toby works  as a sportscaster and his obsession  sometimes goes as far as making out with  Chandra's cardboard cutout check out the  two characters in their real-life  version the free pizza refers to an  episode where Stan Pines promises people  pizza  if they come to his wax figure unveiling  don't these two look super cute these  comic-con cosplayers really took it to  the next level with their unique looks  as even the biggest gravity falls fans  tend to forget about Chandra and Toby we  love the real-life Toby's mustache  Chandra's voice belongs to kari wahlgren  who also voices khloe Carmichael in The  Fairly OddParents and tigress and Kung  Fu Panda legends of Awesomeness  Toby on the other hand is voiced by Greg  Turk inton a well known stand-up  comedian these two characters are such  an amazing pair and we totally ship them  what would their ship name be would it  be show B or Sandra whatever it is we're  totally here for it because they are  really cute together  Robbie Valentino let's move on to Robby  Valentino sarcasm reaches new heights  and gravity falls and most of it is  thanks to this gloomy character he's  self-centered and totally careless and  he's on a mission to wind Wendy's love  he's known to be the emo of gravity  falls  sporty long black hair brushed to one  side he has pale skin several piercings  and a slouched posture as an antagonist  of the show  Robbie is the rival of most main  characters including dipper pines who is  also trying to win Wendy's love the two  always go head-to-head and it never ends  well nevertheless gravity falls wouldn't  be the same without Robbie Valentino  he's pretty accurate real-life version  of Robbie aunty no done by nine ruto  from deviantART check him out he even  has the same red nose and of course he'd  be singing as Wendy his ultimate love  Robbie is originally voiced by TJ Miller  who also voiced truck nut and How to  Train Your Dragon and Fred and big hero  six TJ Miller might as well be a  complete opposite of  be Valentino look at how cheerful he  looks a Wattpad user had an interesting  theory on Robi saying he might actually  be a zombie in one of the zombie scenes  from the show you can see a character  with a hoodie similar to Robbie  Robbie's parents even live in a funeral  home is this just a coincidence or is  there a connection between Robbie and  zombies sheriff blubs we've shown you  some of the main characters some of the  antagonists and side characters whose  personalities make gravity falls even  more amazing sheriff blubs is also one  of the characters clubs is ahead of the  town's police department he normally  works with his partner and the two  prefers skipping their investigations  and going to lunch blobs is sarcastic  lazy but his friendship with his partner  is what makes him an unstoppable police  duo even though the two aren't exactly  the best police you can ask for their  dynamic is without a doubt one of our  favorite parts of the show but let's  take a moment to talk about sheriff  blubs loves is an older overweight man  with grey hair and a gray mustache he's  not very fond of his job and would much  rather do completely pointless  activities instead here's a real-life  version of gloves and of course his  partner Durland is also present the two  are inseparable  their strong friendship actually raised  a lot of eyebrows and gravity falls and  many fans suspect they are one of the  few LGBT characters in the cartoon world  this theory was finally confirmed in the  very last episode of gravity falls  sheriff blubs is voiced by Kevin Michael  Richardson who also voices lester  krinklesac in The Cleveland Show Tiffany  let's talk about a certain side  character that's always making us laugh  every time she comes on screen  Tiffany is a character inside the  computer she is obsessed with being the  center of attention and will do anything  to make sure the players are focused on  her for longer periods of time like any  life gamer giffany tends to go into rage  fairly quickly when things don't go her  way and has no issues with bad-mouthing  others her personality might be  surprising considering she's a pale  skinned girl with long pink hair and a  sailor outfit one of her main powers  includes being able to transfer herself  from one electronic device to the other  and work her way to charm anyone here  her outfit is definitely a popular one  to cosplay as proven by this deviantART  user called Lulu Co gif  is originally voiced by Jessica de Cicco  who you might also recognize as a voice  of Lynne loud in the loud house while  Jessica herself doesn't have pink hair  or wear a sailor's outfit we bet you can  even find more cosplayers who managed to  nail Japanese look Stan Pines gravity  falls is full of unique sight characters  that add a perfect touch to this  extraordinary show but the show also  centers around the pines family one of  the most talked-about families of  gravity falls let's start with Stan  dipper and Mabel's great-uncle Stan is  known as the cunning and greeting con  artist but he has a fantastic sense of  humor and is very loyal to his family as  a good salesman he's never up to any  good but he makes up for it in the  Family Values  appearance-wise Stan's a funny looking  man with big rectangle glasses a gray  beard and gray eyebrows he usually wears  a dark suit and a maroon Fez which  covers most of his head check out this  real-life version of Stan and dipper but  what's even more amazing is this  real-life Stan Pines he even has the  same red nose we've seen on Robbie  Valentino did you know that Stan's voice  belongs to the creator himself Alex  Hirsch also voices soos as well as bill  cipher did you know that Stan's  character was actually based on Alex's  real grandpa and him Stan and his voice  is based on his grandpa bill Alex's  grandpa's must have a really good sense  of sarcasm Mabel pines Mabel pines is  dippers twin sister who was born just a  couple of minutes before her brother by  now we know that the gravity falls  characters aren't exactly regular people  and Maybelle is no exception to that  rule she loves art and according to her  her first word ever was unicorn just  like her brother Mabel is 13 years old  but according to her she's exactly one  millimetre taller than her brother she  has long blond hair braces and she's  constantly changing her outfit unlike  characters on this show she's also  optimistic and fun to be around sounds  like an ideal twin sister right unlike  most cartoon twins these two actually  have an amazing relationship but we'll  get more into that later let's check out  what a real-life Mabel looks like our  first cosplayer is rocking the Mabel  look right down to her purple sweater  this cosplayer is totally nailing her  look to dress like Mabel you'll need to  find a long brown wig  a pink headband and a purple sweater  with a rainbow and a few stars sounds  pretty simple right do you know that the  real Mabel was actually modeled by the  creators twin sister Mabel has a pig  named waddle because his sister always  wanted a pet pig and had an actual  shrine in her room dipper pines let's  talk about gravity falls main character  dipper pines  he's Mabel's twin sister he's smart  curious and always up for an adventure  which sometimes also gets him in trouble  like any younger brother dipper wants to  be taken seriously and doesn't really  enjoy being a child he also can be seen  as pretentious in the eyes of many  gravity falls residents but he does in  fact look like a typical  thirteen-year-old boy his hair is messy  and is usually covered with a blue and  white snapback dipper and Mabel have a  surprisingly wonderful relationship and  they rarely fight they are protective of  each other and have risked their lives  to help each other on more than one  occasion we absolutely adore this  unstoppable twin duo but we do have to  admit that we love differ just look at  his cute face well this real-life  version might just be cuter this cosplay  belongs to Loren Hibbs who did an  amazing job at recreating a live version  of Dipper  dipper is actually inspired by Alex  Hirsch the creator of the show his  adventures are a checklist of everything  Alex wished he could have achieved as a  child we have to say we're incredibly  thankful for Alex's wild imagination if  you love cartoons make sure to check out  our video on 10 loud house characters  all grown up don't forget to subscribe  and hit that thumbs up button see you  next time
 

